   1:Source/render/decoders/tga.c **** /*
   2:Source/render/decoders/tga.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — tga.c
   3:Source/render/decoders/tga.c ****  * TGA decoder (see tga.h). Expands the file into an 8-bit gray raster
   4:Source/render/decoders/tga.c ****  * (truecolor via luminance, palette via 24/32-bit BGR colormap entries, or
   5:Source/render/decoders/tga.c ****  * direct 8-bit gray), then downsamples + Bayer-dithers like bmp.c/tif.c.
   6:Source/render/decoders/tga.c ****  * Handles types 1/2/3 and RLE 9/10/11, bottom-up and top-down, image-ID skip.
   7:Source/render/decoders/tga.c ****  */
